# gwz-test-app.glade — the minimal app declaration the glade-gwz tests boot the
# node with. Declares exactly the two surfaces glade-gwz stands behind, plus the
# workspace share that makes them routable (audit F1: the loading node mints the
# WorkspaceEntry + ServeClaim, so `(ws-razel, gwz.ops)` routes Local).
#
# This mirrors grazel-app.glade's `service … gwz.ops` + `workspace ws-razel razel`
# leg (discovery.ts phase D) and adds the gwz.output log surface for streaming.
glade-app v1
app gwz-test

# the command surface: a directed exchange, answered by the attached provider.
service gwz gwz.ops

# the long-op output surface: appended ops fold + replicate to subscribers.
binding gwz.output log share commons from-cursor

# bootstrap grant (data only — enforcement is stage-2).
seed owner ws-razel gwz.*

# the workspace share this app serves from; the booted loader is its host.
workspace ws-razel razel
